# The canonical pair in the source Xi quotient

The imported modules construct the actual two canonical order-five
factors, prove that they generate the original odd image, and identify
their distinct generating images in X/O₂,Φ(X). Every element normalizing
both X and its original module preserves or interchanges these images.
Full-normalizer and source assembly are in SmallSupport.Completion and
XiMinus.SourceAssembly.
Source: Aschbacher--Smith, Lemma 3.2.13, printed pp.584--585.
-/
